### READING LIST TESTS ( Ex-22)

### Add a blog to a user's reading list (valid userId & blogId)
# Expects: 201 Created with the new ReadingList entry (read defaults to false).
# Adjust userId and blogId to match existing records in your database if needed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/jsonwithout join-table metadata

{
  "userId": 2,
  "blogId": 3
}

### Add a second blog to the same user's reading list
# Useful for verifying that GET /api/users/:id returns multiple blogs in 'readings'.
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "blogId": 4
}

