# Expects: 400 Bad Request with { "error": "Both userId and blogId are required" }.
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

### Not found error: Non-existent userId
# Expects: 404 Not Found with { "error": "User with id 99999 not found" }.
