Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 99999,
  "blogId": 1
}

### Not found error: Non-existent blogId
# Expects: 404 Not Found with { "error": "Blog with id 99999 not found" }.
POST {{baseUrl}}/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "blogId": 99999
}

